Purpose: Structured testing of VPN tunnel connectivity across 5 layers

Usage: ./skill-vpn-e2e-test [OPTIONS]

Options:
  (default)              Quick check of all VPN peers (5 seconds)
  --peer PEER_NAME       Test specific peer (e.g., --peer Vimenca)
  --layer <1-5>          Test specific layer only
  --e2e                  Full E2E test (all layers for specified peer)
  --region REGION        AWS region (default: us-east-2)
  --help                 Show this help

Layers:
  Layer 1: Network Reachability (UDP 500/4500 to endpoints)
  Layer 2: IKE/IPSec Tunnel State (both tunnels UP)
